/*
 * The character set of the JP6502 firmware (Software/common/source/vdp.s),
 * ASCII 32 to 127. Five pixel wide glyphs in bits 7-3; text mode shows
 * bits 7-2 of every pattern byte, so the sixth column is the gap.
 */

